# The cloud image is built from the repository root (it also builds the website). Only these two folders are ever sent to Docker; nothing from the desktop app,
# its data, reports, keys or browser profiles can end up in an image.
*
!cloud
!website
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/data
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.prod.example
!**/.env.preview.example
**/*.log
cloud/test
website/e2e
